Description: quick tasks and notes for GNOME, synced with Google Tasks and Keep
 Rosk keeps tasks and notes at hand in GNOME: a panel menu with today's tasks, quick
 capture with dates, lists and labels typed inline, and a main window with lists,
 subtasks, checklists and note cards. Tasks sync with Google Tasks through GNOME Online
 Accounts, notes with Google Keep. Everything works offline and is sent later.

